# ---- Rust / Cargo ----
# Also holds the e2e scratch dir (target/e2e): keeping every generated artifact
# under target/ keeps the repo license-header check, which greps the working
# tree rather than the index, from tripping over ELFs and keys.
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Keep Cargo.lock: this crate ships a binary, so a pinned lockfile is wanted.
